00:13:57,780 --> 00:14:01,520
I have to monitor Master's metamorphosis or there could be trouble.

262
00:14:01,640 --> 00:14:03,480
Sounds like you're having a hell of a time with it.

263
00:14:03,580 --> 00:14:04,160
Come on, Alpha.

264
00:14:04,280 --> 00:14:05,620
Don't you think this is kind of dumb?

265
00:14:06,100 --> 00:14:07,440
It's what Master ordered.

266
00:14:08,180 --> 00:14:09,000
An order?

267
00:14:09,660 --> 00:14:09,840
Huh.

268
00:14:09,840 --> 00:14:15,840
If my orders were as easy as yours are, I'd be done with my mission.

269
00:14:19,120 --> 00:14:19,600
Wow.

270
00:14:20,140 --> 00:14:21,000
You're pretty lucky.

271
00:14:21,380 --> 00:14:23,000
I bet you don't ever have to worry.

272
00:14:23,660 --> 00:14:24,520
That's not true.

273
00:14:25,480 --> 00:14:27,560
I remember something you said one time.

274
00:14:27,900 --> 00:14:30,520
You told me I would not be able to fool Master forever.

275
00:14:30,520 --> 00:14:39,780
If Master knew the truth about me, he would hate me.

276
00:14:40,340 --> 00:14:42,480
And then I would never get to see him again.

277
00:14:44,080 --> 00:14:47,300
But I know that lying to him is wrong.

278
00:14:48,120 --> 00:14:51,800
I do not know if I can keep hiding this from him day after day.

279
00:14:53,980 --> 00:14:55,140
Tomoki will be fine.

280
00:14:55,820 --> 00:14:56,900
Bugs are all stupid.

281
00:14:57,160 --> 00:14:58,060
He'll never notice.

282
00:14:58,060 --> 00:15:00,620
I'll bury his head in the sand like they all do.

283
00:15:03,360 --> 00:15:04,600
Hi there, Prez.

284
00:15:04,900 --> 00:15:08,640
So, uh, you want me to give your back a good scrub while you're sitting there?

285
00:15:09,660 --> 00:15:10,740
Why not?

286
00:15:10,920 --> 00:15:12,540
I'll take you up on that offer.

287
00:15:13,820 --> 00:15:14,380
Yes!

288
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:20,660
You've waited so long, dear hands of mine.

289
00:15:21,080 --> 00:15:24,800
And you, my fiendish urges, your patience will be rewarded.

290
00:15:25,180 --> 00:15:27,120
Once more into the abyss.

291
00:15:27,120 --> 00:15:29,220
Geronimo!

292
00:15:30,920 --> 00:15:32,200
Yes, my hand slipped.

293
00:15:32,300 --> 00:15:33,720
So sorry about that, Prez.

294
00:15:37,020 --> 00:15:39,400
Yes, yes, yes, yes!

295
00:15:40,180 --> 00:15:41,120
What's the matter?

296
00:15:41,660 --> 00:15:42,460
Something up?

297
00:15:43,840 --> 00:15:47,400
The metamorphosis of Master's body is altered in one area.

298
00:15:48,080 --> 00:15:49,160
Master, we have a problem.

299
00:15:49,160 --> 00:15:53,920
If your excitement continues at this level, it's possible an unknown metamorphosis will occur

300
00:15:53,920 --> 00:15:54,640
as a result.

301
00:15:56,380 --> 00:15:57,600
Master, are you there?

302
00:15:58,660 --> 00:16:00,360
I can wash you, too!

303
00:16:00,700 --> 00:16:01,220
I'm fine.

304
00:16:01,320 --> 00:16:02,100
Don't worry about me.

305
00:16:02,200 --> 00:16:02,860
Let loose!

306
00:16:03,020 --> 00:16:04,360
There's nothing to worry about.

307
00:16:04,460 --> 00:16:05,980
I mean, we are all ladies here.

308
00:16:05,980 --> 00:16:23,780
Master, do you require assistance?

309
00:16:23,780 --> 00:16:25,900
Master, can you hear me?

310
00:16:25,900 --> 00:16:29,540
We're all girls here?

311
00:16:31,620 --> 00:16:31,780
Yes!

312
00:16:32,640 --> 00:16:33,000
Yes!

313
00:16:33,360 --> 00:16:33,460
Yes!

314
00:16:33,520 --> 00:16:33,880
Yes!

315
00:16:34,940 --> 00:16:35,580
Yes!

316
00:16:40,580 --> 00:16:41,500
Hi, girls, dear!

317
00:16:41,500 --> 00:16:48,220
Looks like the poor kid's completely lost himself.

318
00:16:49,380 --> 00:16:51,340
What the hell's going on with Tomoko?

319
00:16:51,800 --> 00:16:53,380
The boss turned into a battlefield.

320
00:16:54,000 --> 00:16:55,660
I'm not saying that's a bad thing, mind you.

321
00:16:55,680 --> 00:16:57,500
It is horribly interesting to watch.

322
00:17:00,540 --> 00:17:02,340
You must calm down, Master.

323
00:17:02,720 --> 00:17:05,500
If you do not, the quantum transformation device will...

324
00:17:05,500 --> 00:17:10,500
Yes! Yes! Yes! Yes! Yes! Yes!

325
00:17:11,500 --> 00:17:17,020
What on earth?

326
00:17:18,640 --> 00:17:21,700
Someone want to tell me what a faucet is doing stuck here?

327
00:17:24,760 --> 00:17:26,000
Total meltdown.

328
00:17:34,540 --> 00:17:37,360
I think I'll take my leave now.

329
00:17:41,500 --> 00:17:43,260
Zora, you dropped your bath down.

330
00:17:43,260 --> 00:17:45,580
Here, let me pick it up for you, if that's cool.

331
00:17:46,380 --> 00:17:48,620
I don't care if you see me naked right now.

332
00:17:48,620 --> 00:17:50,840
I don't care if the image stays with you forever.

333
00:17:51,240 --> 00:17:54,420
All I care about is my insatiable desire to kill you!

334
00:18:01,920 --> 00:18:04,940
It's a sign of wisdom, Tomoki, to know when to pull out.

335
00:18:04,940 --> 00:18:10,240
That's right. Keep scrubbing till it's all good and clean.

336
00:18:10,240 --> 00:18:11,740
Yes, ma'am, I will.

337
00:18:12,540 --> 00:18:15,160
Oh, we can finally bathe in peace.

338
00:18:16,660 --> 00:18:19,400
Yep, shouldn't be anyone else here but us right now.

339
00:18:25,820 --> 00:18:27,220
It's really nice.

340
00:18:27,380 --> 00:18:28,920
Yeah, I could get used to this.

341
00:18:28,920 --> 00:18:33,260
With Icarus still having those wings sticking out and Nymph being worried about her choker,

342
00:18:33,260 --> 00:18:34,760
it took guts coming in here.

343
00:18:34,760 --> 00:18:37,480
I mean it. You have more courage than most girls our age.

344
00:18:37,480 --> 00:18:38,680
Geez, I'm sorry.

345
00:18:38,680 --> 00:18:41,640
I didn't even notice those things might have made you two uncomfortable.

346
00:18:41,640 --> 00:18:44,760
I've just gotten used to the idea of you two as normal girls.

347
00:18:44,760 --> 00:18:46,680
I forget that you're actually angeloids.

348
00:18:46,680 --> 00:18:50,280
Guess I should get out of my own head a bit and think about you sometimes.

349
00:18:50,280 --> 00:18:53,000
But it makes me happy.

350
00:18:53,000 --> 00:18:54,840
I don't want you to change.

351
00:18:54,840 --> 00:18:57,640
I want you to see me just as another normal girl.

352
00:18:59,560 --> 00:19:03,400
Although what I really want is to be even more human for Master.

353
00:19:06,440 --> 00:19:07,960
You're fine the way you are.

354
00:19:08,120 --> 00:19:09,020
Don't change a thing.

355
00:19:09,340 --> 00:19:12,320
And you can't go around lying like that time at the park, okay?

356
00:19:12,500 --> 00:19:15,220
I know you better than you might think and you're bigger than that.

357
00:19:15,540 --> 00:19:16,720
So no more lying.

358
00:19:17,200 --> 00:19:19,180
So it is a bad thing to lie.

359
00:19:19,180 --> 00:19:21,660
Yeah, it's bad. Promise me you won't do it.

360
00:19:22,380 --> 00:19:23,580
There. It's a promise.

361
00:19:24,140 --> 00:19:27,500
Liar, liar, pants on fire, hanging from a telephone wire.

362
00:19:39,500 --> 00:19:41,500
I have to tell Master the truth now.

363
00:19:42,140 --> 00:19:43,100
I made a promise.

364
00:19:43,100 --> 00:19:46,060
Oh, hey. Glad you were finally able to take a bath.

365
00:19:46,060 --> 00:19:51,020
The old lady in charge of the bathhouse made me scrub down the whole thing until it was freaking spotless.

366
00:19:51,020 --> 00:19:54,380
Master, I have something important to tell you.

367
00:19:54,380 --> 00:20:02,620
There is something I've been hiding from you for a long time now, but I'm afraid of what might happen if I tell you.

368
00:20:04,300 --> 00:20:06,060
I'm afraid you might hate me.

369
00:20:06,060 --> 00:20:13,580
Good job, Icarus.

370
00:20:13,580 --> 00:20:16,240
Seriously, you're becoming more human every day.

371
00:20:16,740 --> 00:20:18,240
You don't even realize it, do you?

372
00:20:18,960 --> 00:20:22,380
Human beings always have one or two little things they hide from each other.

373
00:20:22,920 --> 00:20:23,560
It's normal.

374
00:20:25,340 --> 00:20:25,860
Master.

375
00:20:25,860 --> 00:20:37,780
When you're ready to talk about it, let me know. We're family now.

376
00:20:39,860 --> 00:20:43,000
What'd I say? I knew Tomuki would be just fine.

377
00:20:43,000 --> 00:20:48,920
I wish I had a nice master.

378
00:20:52,440 --> 00:20:55,900
Sugata, do you have any idea what the Angeloids actually are?

379
00:20:57,060 --> 00:21:02,900
Not like I've got an answer, but when I was a kid, I thought it would be cool to have a robot maid who'd do whatever I wanted.

380
00:21:03,320 --> 00:21:08,420
Really, though, in the end, I don't want Icarus to suffer for me. Not in any way.

381
00:21:08,420 --> 00:21:16,200
The only thing I know for sure is that far above us in the sky, there is a new world.

382
00:21:16,760 --> 00:21:19,840
Icarus and Nymph are both trapped by the rules that govern them.

383
00:21:20,300 --> 00:21:21,620
I don't know the specifics.

384
00:21:24,460 --> 00:21:26,680
I wonder who created the Angeloids.

385
00:21:27,200 --> 00:21:28,860
I mean, somebody had to, right?

386
00:21:30,740 --> 00:21:32,040
I want to punch them.

387
00:21:38,420 --> 00:22:08,400
I want to punch them.

388
00:22:08,420 --> 00:22:08,920
I want to punch them.

389
00:22:08,920 --> 00:22:10,920
Oh

390
00:22:38,920 --> 00:22:45,920
He went into a man alone

391
00:22:45,920 --> 00:22:51,920
Come on, come on, come on, come on, come on

392
00:22:51,920 --> 00:22:57,920
Come on, come on, come on, come on

393
00:23:08,920 --> 00:23:11,920
At the rate she's going now, she might just run away

394
00:23:11,920 --> 00:23:12,920
Are you okay with that?

395
00:23:12,920 --> 00:23:14,920
I'm not concerned

396
00:23:14,920 --> 00:23:17,920
As long as I keep hold of this chain, she cannot escape

397
00:23:17,920 --> 00:23:21,920
Besides, I've already decided to scrap her

398
00:23:21,920 --> 00:23:24,920
My goodness, aren't you awful?

399
00:23:24,920 --> 00:23:26,920
I can't wait

400
00:23:26,920 --> 00:23:31,920
It's been a while since I've been this excited about anything

401
00:23:31,920 --> 00:23:38,920
Next time, Chains of No Escape

